{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "4972a522be98408fc21e094cf9f6bc1533de094e1ee597414158e66b7ed00ce3",
  "bundle_request_count": 27,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:047423cc963ecfc676b229b10cd83309bb3561d3dcd7cc7030020ec432548cab",
      "request_id": "047423cc963ecfc676b229b10cd83309bb3561d3dcd7cc7030020ec432548cab",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "90e2a878fd2a96cc746acd848d2c6e13",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以最后，把问题留给你：四次决赛、三次失利、一次重伤、一百二十五场胜利——这个年终第一，是六年坚持熬出来的实力兑现，还是对手缺席的时代让位？你站哪边，评论区见。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "62e4b7f6427bc4281c088981474318f523e49bdaf3a0e73a8bad1e14d22c07cc",
      "words_sha256": "d15e2167eb03b797590f4c2afb8c84e02ee963b378e3ac537c3a3aecf41b31d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0c05b113dabee738575c0490c7e033474e508bc226d7e6f4ba0bfcf41e7b039a",
      "request_id": "0c05b113dabee738575c0490c7e033474e508bc226d7e6f4ba0bfcf41e7b039a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "87db05eae9cdb177c190987b47c921d1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "然后，剧本翻了：蒂姆连扳两盘，抢七锁定胜局。四小时零两分钟，兹维列夫把到手的冠军打了出去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "91ba0cc52004d0c7573f929d669a9328291759d0917c6312d74460655bbbe991",
      "words_sha256": "385876259830c940e5fe8a89c0ca904bdcbf10f254f65895e1cf60db1697de28"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1d72aa3e4c1673434f6f718a750e313659bfc86b17981292f0b1f30f893439b1",
      "request_id": "1d72aa3e4c1673434f6f718a750e313659bfc86b17981292f0b1f30f893439b1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4e36cd90224dc305ceb170064c707614",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘五比四，又一次发球胜赛——又一次被破。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f62d8f0b12a2981d2cfb0ef2c58a9daa9c3339106901f67758cc4d17d99a0632",
      "words_sha256": "8227e99c2d41258e6f3fec432ebcdd77860017e1b066ea78f487fe2866fd93c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1fc817da66c70ffe8a007340a88a4df34218b6074c757f62cb6a0c552919ab16",
      "request_id": "1fc817da66c70ffe8a007340a88a4df34218b6074c757f62cb6a0c552919ab16",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ffad11008f3a11bbdf4adbc719c024e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二六年的一月，同样的剧本差点又演一遍：澳网半决赛，他和阿尔卡拉斯打了五小时二十七分钟。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "24008f1ba1c93cfaf3943c45041b469abb30e5348386b31d417ec99d8aa8027f",
      "words_sha256": "aae5edcae281b28af1bbae58f4e039c6d3d48d01e49ee93d2b3e94cad8ddbea0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2454c063bd094acb1ae77e41e9717eaaebe7dd565bb8f98e9c55409cedc39f3b",
      "request_id": "2454c063bd094acb1ae77e41e9717eaaebe7dd565bb8f98e9c55409cedc39f3b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3ec8d476c5c55afe8452f42c8ed74ef5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二五年，墨尔本决赛对辛纳，对方全场没有送出一个破发点，直落三盘把他打回更衣室。三次大满贯决赛，三次亚军。奥运会金牌、总决赛冠军、大师赛冠军，他什么都有，只差这一座。「最强的无冕之王」——这句话从夸奖，慢慢变成了判决。而且面前只剩最后一级台阶：公开赛年代，只有伦德尔和穆雷，是以决赛四连败开局的。再输一次，他就要和这份名单并排站着。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5cc94ea1b1f0cd34278c23bd9089f058646bfa2f6fe48b0dbfd32521c9250b27",
      "words_sha256": "e9f218563486696e0980eb41b753e5509c097acaa4d312807ef3501e2ff90d9c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:26465e59ab80cb88a36a6279663a96f284761cf45ee05ec20f1b29ac422e4fca",
      "request_id": "26465e59ab80cb88a36a6279663a96f284761cf45ee05ec20f1b29ac422e4fca",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b2175bfd8a2985e69500278a394cb681",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "中间隔着的，是三次大满贯决赛失利，和整整一百二十五场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f16a0a03576c26207cd95da5794534bc4c85f9269ec6234fb1e77f1f40ce379a",
      "words_sha256": "6bdafb4724073fffee691e9c0d3cfd84a19207839fc01658bed8b41b3fbaafe8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:499a82f9f61bb20fceaff6b2d0c34596bad21d8adff716987445681ca9307d54",
      "request_id": "499a82f9f61bb20fceaff6b2d0c34596bad21d8adff716987445681ca9307d54",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3a27702d8e475382d67184d05baac87a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半年后，巴黎。这一回，签表先替他让开了路：阿尔卡拉斯因伤缺席，辛纳第二轮爆冷出局，德约止步第三轮——他一路没碰上一个世界前十。决赛对科博利，他第四盘抢七三比一领先被翻盘，还抽了筋。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c25eb35f025409ea8cdf27ce0b750b7aacb3d74a184f33064d0bc7cf99c754a1",
      "words_sha256": "c17c29b4b8acff7ba7c8fad76c5d86ca35dcc1ce32e2b386a7e7e0628b96332b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4ab5be9cb7af427866089ed8f756691849305f95e5c8c812a80ddd3edac8b20f",
      "request_id": "4ab5be9cb7af427866089ed8f756691849305f95e5c8c812a80ddd3edac8b20f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2b718a67746893073ba57affe6199d31",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四年前，就在这片球场上，他坐着轮椅离开，不知道自己还能不能回来。四年后，他躺倒在同一片红土上——这一次，是以冠军的身份。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "decce5ffbead29a9179b833674764dbaaf2abdf2be29c8aed7ccb137de0448ab",
      "words_sha256": "c5bb39a5eacd26c60c95982f8c06c7552d1def82399b35a088add27c50f12691"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:64a4c60e5a733be1ccbc8acd21e2cd1bd3f6cb570365e40f61bb4d53685b14b5",
      "request_id": "64a4c60e5a733be1ccbc8acd21e2cd1bd3f6cb570365e40f61bb4d53685b14b5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "97e42ee7b3132714e8ca0b8b6a0b23b6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "就在这个十月，他把这一年收了个尾：上海，阿尔卡拉斯提前出局，年终世界第一提前锁定——他是德国网球史上第一位年终第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a00274206580188c839655299b6a3c54923e81cd29fbe3dcb764851003d576fb",
      "words_sha256": "187b8dae032e4b7051c7c279810d508dd9393319e43b7c3670c60e42d3b62b61"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:71c080ffc59cea6c2af654a82dc9961067bab5e3b9d13fbf4e53f27f02d9ebe4",
      "request_id": "71c080ffc59cea6c2af654a82dc9961067bab5e3b9d13fbf4e53f27f02d9ebe4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "26449952d167bad82b11b9cf6c490dbf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第四次决赛才捧杯，他凭什么一年封王？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "39f3906abfd60f26b1aaa4bb03d2dc241ee1978ffe1d2664f7d0dab25febbdf5",
      "words_sha256": "8027466a68f61bca7e937c875a74a7b6d0cd2beb1c97697cab14d8eaada3a5da"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7a86a6ab0e3ece2b5afb3c3ee7f3e073c43957652a0dde1e3ee9ae9a187d2058",
      "request_id": "7a86a6ab0e3ece2b5afb3c3ee7f3e073c43957652a0dde1e3ee9ae9a187d2058",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "10c2a1c4e8f22db9e61b99d5e0b66738",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下周一，二十九岁的兹维列夫，名字后面将第一次缀上「世界第一」。以他的年龄首登榜首，五十二年来只有一个人比他更晚；而「第一次当上年终第一」这件事，他比阿加西的纪录还要老三天，是历史第一人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1548bbeabeac5739a116cc5647da42e2c733e67070692de7c7511780ecf3d6cc",
      "words_sha256": "ecfec3ec8ac4b9e7e8758af6c49e81ee7ffe38aff8ec2e4446cfe4afce5a7d85"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8e9ce29e279de0244b05030635ada4bf6e2eb21b473b48025a3451b39f34de9c",
      "request_id": "8e9ce29e279de0244b05030635ada4bf6e2eb21b473b48025a3451b39f34de9c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "554e7280d5a8429162b5f6af36435f4d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二二年，巴黎半决赛，对面是纳达尔。三个多小时，第二盘还没打完，比分七比六、六比六。第二盘的最后一个球，他追一记正手，右脚踝在红土上拧成了不该有的角度。惨叫声里，他坐着轮椅离开了球场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2469066069242896a54b4570c89d8c4a6a9726eabae936a10340cec987853296",
      "words_sha256": "6cef4d0cd86f499d8a9495c04b5c8247c0e4915bc7e2ed51befc42426e15c702"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8f6cef2f05e0d87e1f1de7663ed63a77f6db358b9b921ebb0a320ed8e1f3c3d3",
      "request_id": "8f6cef2f05e0d87e1f1de7663ed63a77f6db358b9b921ebb0a320ed8e1f3c3d3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2f0c1d632595f7af2f05fd38b60cc428",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他两盘在手，决胜盘打到五比三，迎来自己的发球胜赛局——离奖杯，只剩两分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ee08f2a1000d9d0f9f2352a295176f59c014cb8378620864f6420297ebb972a3",
      "words_sha256": "c8febf2904412ce15a1a5eac8f51071d475d16c018235c62e874c688edc9666d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a52cc0bea428c6c4781256b882f6694613f27e52793cb054ec9309a20f77480",
      "request_id": "9a52cc0bea428c6c4781256b882f6694613f27e52793cb054ec9309a20f77480",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "35a942931bec2efd9b534013342c9608",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "你可以说这个第一来得晚。但在他看来，它先得回答另一个问题：他到底配不配。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "31e18858b9f5a145a0ba0d3ed5d67460e19d40fac5489f78ba6347f67afd4109",
      "words_sha256": "7234405c9fa14ef75a8e26140686b1d9f3b25ea0c1e1e034f5ad568a2b1529c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9aa0bb94ec79652ef14881c05a8dfd39878f741abe8efe818e1cfc26e3e78c77",
      "request_id": "9aa0bb94ec79652ef14881c05a8dfd39878f741abe8efe818e1cfc26e3e78c77",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4360f01861b56390ae94dfd7b446e58b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛，他三比一拿下谢尔顿。赛点兑现的那一刻，他甚至没意识到比赛已经结束，转身走回底线，准备接发球，几秒之后才反应过来：三十年了，德国人又一次在纽约捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ef2d49e55bf3190684a34cad0018bbcee228843a1153f1a2e1895a99c2491a8f",
      "words_sha256": "8600e3874f7c36586b30ad365cc67b6e669564a49926b28cd09e039b7bf2c1d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a557e3268705ac06214eb1cd0ad337cf01bbea782e25d2fd23dc275dd554b02b",
      "request_id": "a557e3268705ac06214eb1cd0ad337cf01bbea782e25d2fd23dc275dd554b02b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "310722796c8f5d718be7e0fd4900781b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二零年，纽约，空荡荡的阿瑟·阿什球场。二十三岁的兹维列夫第一次站上大满贯决赛，对手蒂姆。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "722ec60d20f9fcc1a67faca3ba1e1a02fc327e81646152a9523481960af9161b",
      "words_sha256": "2215c827b03430519fcba588dff1d419175b644c980725ab3b25b799744b2909"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a967dec0b9ec9b604b886817972ed2b406e36168f5ade43dd5f73356cb0c30cb",
      "request_id": "a967dec0b9ec9b604b886817972ed2b406e36168f5ade43dd5f73356cb0c30cb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "69bdedd5ea3f171eeb7c734d4b4a4641",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一胜，是他大满贯的第一百二十五场胜利——公开赛年代，没有人为了第一座奖杯，赢下过这么多场比赛。第四十一次参赛，他终于捧杯。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4a9eb9b0e535e811219395c265e7d19e36ac40854b8629552888d318f3362a26",
      "words_sha256": "1dd5b03950c8063e54b41168a6bff505cef8c10d036743868f37154b78d12e6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:abe5f478c4a916831e26b35f73067e0ba2af4119e18b0fce8aa70f1e9bed73d8",
      "request_id": "abe5f478c4a916831e26b35f73067e0ba2af4119e18b0fce8aa70f1e9bed73d8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b609b3d6b98ba0059ea394641aa8ed3b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但账本的另一面，必须摊开：这一年，他对辛纳零胜五负，全年只从对方手里抢下一盘；法网夺冠，他没碰前十；年终第一，是在辛纳宣布赛季报销六天之后锁定的。质疑者说：这不是封王，是让位。而他的回答是……",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f0c068fd60a086f6bebdeceac51ddb5dc2532d39cd7fc1bc565706f6ec0b1bb2",
      "words_sha256": "7e0c835f5cee115047e59921d8099a7dd07bac97ac80a08e12525b3af8f00089"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ad1223895a68b5ccc18b09adb9c3776ce61df6a90c39dfa6c28cd925a105620b",
      "request_id": "ad1223895a68b5ccc18b09adb9c3776ce61df6a90c39dfa6c28cd925a105620b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "78aafcbf8cfbd435a3e8c897341fd345",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "故事到这里，本来已经够圆满。但今年还没完：温网，他职业生涯第一次打进决赛，先赢一盘，还是输给了辛纳。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eadff0a7d8ee068bb2f4dedb9d5f82175e91a820385f88e065123709fa45eafe",
      "words_sha256": "ce7f92e15e985e3bcc00a278e0177d11054f3b16977525d60002830dbce23157"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b6b701a1d35638907d942cc1327b9c71d0a6167b8365565fabd163c8f5ae1164",
      "request_id": "b6b701a1d35638907d942cc1327b9c71d0a6167b8365565fabd163c8f5ae1164",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af22f51fce8f3da423780517f6e00b95",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eacb577c623a5937ba7a39d6597a15de28cb3b5c1a6a20d4746582ee5b9b63e5",
      "words_sha256": "74d567be7f7803b20932324ddb499c26d9b44b49f356f71996592439089032e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bba3349961dcaeebc9b2373836c89fa8f9f0febb6e9f8383c1daa75b9c66c181",
      "request_id": "bba3349961dcaeebc9b2373836c89fa8f9f0febb6e9f8383c1daa75b9c66c181",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af4e5a1649cd48f28735a807f4a3c08f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "维也纳，他用一场胜利把积分钉死。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9f7db4eaea606128db070c2f6e48fcd807f3dc02c8f8c6b48d32e93bc1199d86",
      "words_sha256": "522cac0b0a53d7fa76088512d0190a4165f1bcae35e8c422c184f3d28f4a0b15"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c16c45299489221f007a6f587790ddc288bce9b09189ca7a4a023c35d7d0e6f4",
      "request_id": "c16c45299489221f007a6f587790ddc288bce9b09189ca7a4a023c35d7d0e6f4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3f28c61d80b6a37ddc54a2a3c45a2d31",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可他真的一步一步打了回来。二零二四年，还是巴黎，决赛对阿尔卡拉斯，他一度两盘比一盘领先——然后又被连扳两盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "714fdb7b98d0b4b0951cdfb4f9fc15025ad52353f0f15c33e207abeab78f8f0d",
      "words_sha256": "bef715454fd41ada32696eea37279428664428ef718c1034bf290dd38829bafb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dbd8b3d6e8ec62b03e8d72c5133474a0deb2ab6f15d52bdaa7cb2258402268b8",
      "request_id": "dbd8b3d6e8ec62b03e8d72c5133474a0deb2ab6f15d52bdaa7cb2258402268b8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3bebd87d3e66d0f6ccee85c099538c50",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "诊断结果：右脚踝三条外侧韧带全部撕裂，随即手术。秋季又查出骨水肿，整个赛季报销。七个月后他才重新站上赛场，而他自己的说法是：网球，又花了一年才找回来。那时没人再提二零二零年那句「站回来」——能站回来走路，已经算赢了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "792469d430f49a21bce9ae4ae966f74003043b52cb12a73f471f5fecfad034a5",
      "words_sha256": "40efaf13b4f20284d800eea539a098d30f4203b16fc461843919be0d6f9bd6c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dde9ce209ccf82a27d3361c6df18c39ff9a195c1c8b2fc4539f50cad9de8dcb8",
      "request_id": "dde9ce209ccf82a27d3361c6df18c39ff9a195c1c8b2fc4539f50cad9de8dcb8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7311fd9f5ce5010231b4561a65e376a4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他说，他想和最强的人同场竞技，哪怕今年被对方赢了五次。这个月，巴黎和都灵还在等他——这个「第一」的成色，接下来三周，还得他自己一场一场验。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "024fd1031d851dbbc3ec7a3fa790d68aa2ba4aea3deb42a4d953f36b2f98dc6f",
      "words_sha256": "d77a86439aed6f8b5f786570b60f984a079393159fd9298f0a6544cc9519e472"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e25a93bb9bd85c4f75987fa9b5037605248d2d8d1adc5de6198a619cef71fac8",
      "request_id": "e25a93bb9bd85c4f75987fa9b5037605248d2d8d1adc5de6198a619cef71fac8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8737fd85326a9b53410a042f335c283f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年他说，自己总有一天会站回来。没人想到，这一天要等六年；更没人想到，等他的先是一张轮椅。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d43b1aad81996fa09b3a9f0c27637350ac2179c95811ad58de9b80435c854776",
      "words_sha256": "9d9adc88cd472aeb77139df9b9b725c1c61f827690e79bb5eb71591706ed4ed4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e3828341f03321b9afb8f996a95fcf6fae72f8dcaac2582440a611008e7c4c07",
      "request_id": "e3828341f03321b9afb8f996a95fcf6fae72f8dcaac2582440a611008e7c4c07",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2c1e6ea4621f22d2968c2fe569fa1b2b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，他六比一收官。冠军点落地，他倒在红土上，久久没有起来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0f3c2a5d2e79b24e5bb5fa4473394504648e5803bb629d57d631aa84d1f6e11c",
      "words_sha256": "729544b0074bc7a805f569d4c4d23c42690ba887df802ced641754f87c80ec49"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ef3df02269cdf827acd62c45c28432ef30efa0ffb1969057cd79d210e55cae6f",
      "request_id": "ef3df02269cdf827acd62c45c28432ef30efa0ffb1969057cd79d210e55cae6f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f10baaca3ae4842f84794c6638b4fc3a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两个月后在纽约，他成了头号种子——辛纳因膝伤提前结束了赛季。首轮，他离出局只差两分；次轮，他打满五盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f24c960af3cedf1075b262eda8a77f7f5a8d7ed7861c8512f3a9284aa1680a28",
      "words_sha256": "7998f5158412ac441931352a8e064e81d011b61b688f6bd0231c8c523db7edb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "decce5ffbead29a9179b833674764dbaaf2abdf2be29c8aed7ccb137de0448ab",
      "words_sha256": "c5bb39a5eacd26c60c95982f8c06c7552d1def82399b35a088add27c50f12691",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2b718a67746893073ba57affe6199d31",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四年前，就在这片球场上，他坐着轮椅离开，不知道自己还能不能回来。四年后，他躺倒在同一片红土上——这一次，是以冠军的身份。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f16a0a03576c26207cd95da5794534bc4c85f9269ec6234fb1e77f1f40ce379a",
      "words_sha256": "6bdafb4724073fffee691e9c0d3cfd84a19207839fc01658bed8b41b3fbaafe8",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b2175bfd8a2985e69500278a394cb681",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "中间隔着的，是三次大满贯决赛失利，和整整一百二十五场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a00274206580188c839655299b6a3c54923e81cd29fbe3dcb764851003d576fb",
      "words_sha256": "187b8dae032e4b7051c7c279810d508dd9393319e43b7c3670c60e42d3b62b61",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "97e42ee7b3132714e8ca0b8b6a0b23b6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "就在这个十月，他把这一年收了个尾：上海，阿尔卡拉斯提前出局，年终世界第一提前锁定——他是德国网球史上第一位年终第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9f7db4eaea606128db070c2f6e48fcd807f3dc02c8f8c6b48d32e93bc1199d86",
      "words_sha256": "522cac0b0a53d7fa76088512d0190a4165f1bcae35e8c422c184f3d28f4a0b15",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "af4e5a1649cd48f28735a807f4a3c08f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "维也纳，他用一场胜利把积分钉死。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1548bbeabeac5739a116cc5647da42e2c733e67070692de7c7511780ecf3d6cc",
      "words_sha256": "ecfec3ec8ac4b9e7e8758af6c49e81ee7ffe38aff8ec2e4446cfe4afce5a7d85",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "10c2a1c4e8f22db9e61b99d5e0b66738",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下周一，二十九岁的兹维列夫，名字后面将第一次缀上「世界第一」。以他的年龄首登榜首，五十二年来只有一个人比他更晚；而「第一次当上年终第一」这件事，他比阿加西的纪录还要老三天，是历史第一人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "31e18858b9f5a145a0ba0d3ed5d67460e19d40fac5489f78ba6347f67afd4109",
      "words_sha256": "7234405c9fa14ef75a8e26140686b1d9f3b25ea0c1e1e034f5ad568a2b1529c1",
      "words_path": "voice_05.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "35a942931bec2efd9b534013342c9608",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "你可以说这个第一来得晚。但在他看来，它先得回答另一个问题：他到底配不配。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "722ec60d20f9fcc1a67faca3ba1e1a02fc327e81646152a9523481960af9161b",
      "words_sha256": "2215c827b03430519fcba588dff1d419175b644c980725ab3b25b799744b2909",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "310722796c8f5d718be7e0fd4900781b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二零年，纽约，空荡荡的阿瑟·阿什球场。二十三岁的兹维列夫第一次站上大满贯决赛，对手蒂姆。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ee08f2a1000d9d0f9f2352a295176f59c014cb8378620864f6420297ebb972a3",
      "words_sha256": "c8febf2904412ce15a1a5eac8f51071d475d16c018235c62e874c688edc9666d",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2f0c1d632595f7af2f05fd38b60cc428",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他两盘在手，决胜盘打到五比三，迎来自己的发球胜赛局——离奖杯，只剩两分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "91ba0cc52004d0c7573f929d669a9328291759d0917c6312d74460655bbbe991",
      "words_sha256": "385876259830c940e5fe8a89c0ca904bdcbf10f254f65895e1cf60db1697de28",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "87db05eae9cdb177c190987b47c921d1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "然后，剧本翻了：蒂姆连扳两盘，抢七锁定胜局。四小时零两分钟，兹维列夫把到手的冠军打了出去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d43b1aad81996fa09b3a9f0c27637350ac2179c95811ad58de9b80435c854776",
      "words_sha256": "9d9adc88cd472aeb77139df9b9b725c1c61f827690e79bb5eb71591706ed4ed4",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8737fd85326a9b53410a042f335c283f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "那年他说，自己总有一天会站回来。没人想到，这一天要等六年；更没人想到，等他的先是一张轮椅。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2469066069242896a54b4570c89d8c4a6a9726eabae936a10340cec987853296",
      "words_sha256": "6cef4d0cd86f499d8a9495c04b5c8247c0e4915bc7e2ed51befc42426e15c702",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "554e7280d5a8429162b5f6af36435f4d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二二年，巴黎半决赛，对面是纳达尔。三个多小时，第二盘还没打完，比分七比六、六比六。第二盘的最后一个球，他追一记正手，右脚踝在红土上拧成了不该有的角度。惨叫声里，他坐着轮椅离开了球场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "792469d430f49a21bce9ae4ae966f74003043b52cb12a73f471f5fecfad034a5",
